{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 25, :comments ["<b>Before the mountains were sunk</b> — like: \"Why did Adonijah sink?\" (1 Kings 2:15), and both derive from the root of \"they sank in the Sea of Suf [Reed Sea]\" (Exodus 15:5). And the meaning: upon their foundations sunk in the depths of the waters."], :book :proverbs, :voice :ibn-ezra, :lang :en, :chapter 8, :notes {}, :source-witnesses [["Ibn Ezra on Proverbs -- Daat" "http://www.daat.ac.il/he-il/tanach/parshanut_hamikra/full-text/eben-ezra/mishley/"]], :timestamp "2026-07-09T19:21:30.275420607Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}